usage: cli.py [-h]
              {discover,capture,render-signed,datax-once,datax-check-receipt,prepare-docs} ...

Public Workbench local workflow CLI. No command modifies the production
library.

positional arguments:
  {discover,capture,render-signed,datax-once,datax-check-receipt,prepare-docs}
    discover            从用户URL建候选，或一次读取Appinn/SSPai RSS
    capture             顺序获取唯一新URL；首错持久STOP、零重试
    render-signed       从显式SIGNED结构化签收生成只读viewer工作区
    datax-once          满足当前官方证据与单次费用门禁后最多发一个DataX GET
    datax-check-receipt
                        只查原请求回执一次，不重发原请求
    prepare-docs        一次读取三份固定官方文档并与已审核原文SHA比较；不查账户、不收费

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
